content.text:
A type selector chooses elements by their element name.

```css
p {
  color: #555;
}
```

This rule can affect every paragraph.

An id names one specific element on the page.

```css
<h1 id="page-title">Forge</h1>
```

The CSS selector starts with #:

```css
#page-title {
  color: darkorange;
}
```

